{
 "comment": "gst_ledgers_3b, no GSTR-3B, with a GSTR-1 named: the book of g3b_classify, with GSTR-1 rows the reference would read for a month's gap if a GSTR-3B were supplied: b2b invoices dated in another month (c01, c20) and in the same month (c18, after the period), a cdnr note in another month (c04), an amendment of an invoice (b2ba, c02) and of a note (cdnra, c16), a b2cs row, a row with no date and a row naming no voucher. With no GSTR-3B row the reference reads none of them: its dump is byte for byte g3b_classify's (the ledger GUIDs are kept, so the ledger tags agree), and the crate's test, which takes no GSTR-1, gives it.",
